  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>&nbsp;and let the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math> be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.&nbsp;Then the largest element in the set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is an integer solution of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>}</mo></math>&nbsp;is ______",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>,</p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>, then,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So, maximum value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.</p>",
